  "admissionConditions": [
    "Each mapped source uses its own exact alpha>16 component contour; pixel-centre nonzero proof retains every assigned opaque body/blade/hand pixel and no other figure.",
    "Each source has measured standing-height calibration; preview uses an independent body axis and physical UID stature.",
    "Separate live browser and engine QA remains required; art review approval is not a certificate that gameplay integration has passed."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "Target is closest faithful2.5D adaptation; no pixel-perfect original footage or absolute1:1 certification.",
    "Small front three-quarter KONAMI images do not attest hidden/rear microgeometry, concealed fingers, every engraving or original3D animations.",
    "Opposing main cameras are separately authored, no software mirroring. Native PNG bytes remain intact; runtime vector component clipping excludes low-alpha generation fringe and neighboring atlas figures.",
    "Twenty-one action groups per facing share15 mapped main keyposes. Sixteen drawings exist per main atlas; high side kick remains unused. Corrective low-left replaces one old high pose. Extra repair neutral/action figures are calibration-only or preserved, never represented as extra animation frames.",
    "Source MGR kit is authored CQC balancing, not timings/damage/motion capture from the original game. It has no projectile attacks; no firearm muzzle, grenade shot or bidon origin is invented.",
    "Inherited specialDown/ascending-blade label still selects source deploy/recover canister art; missing faithful ascending-blade motion is documented pending, never certified by these costumes."
